# Game shader permutations: same format as content/shaders/shaders.manifest, with <file> under
# content/game/shaders. Baked by de_shaders next to the engine's; a file name may not also be in
# content/shaders. These shaders may include content/shaders .hlsli files by name.

Camouflage.hlsl VSMain vs
Camouflage.hlsl VSMainStatic vs
Camouflage.hlsl PSMain ps

Echo.hlsl VSMain vs
Echo.hlsl PSSnapshot ps ECHO_SNAPSHOT=1
Echo.hlsl PSComposite ps

VisionModes.hlsl VSMain vs
VisionModes.hlsl PSMain ps
